key.description:
Placeholders: {album_artist}, {album}, {dated_album} ((YYYY-MM-DD) - album),
{date}, {year}, {genre}, {label}, {disc}, {totaldiscs}, {disc_folder}
(CD1/CD2 only when total discs > 1; empty otherwise — prefer
{disc_track} in the filename instead). Settings offers common presets;
Custom keeps a freeform template.
